WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:21.134
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:25.366
I'm a grizzly bear.

3
00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:29.648
That's a type of brown bear.

4
00:00:29.649 --> 00:00:32.564
Where do you live?

5
00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:38.409
I live in Alaska like many grizzly bears.

6
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:45.762
We live in forests, meadows, and tundra.

7
00:00:45.763 --> 00:00:49.460
You are very big.

8
00:00:49.461 --> 00:00:54.677
Yes, and we can run fast too.

9
00:00:54.678 --> 00:01:00.327
We also have long claws.

10
00:01:00.328 --> 00:01:03.559
Are you dangerous?

11
00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:07.759
Grizzly bears are usually peaceful.

12
00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:13.904
But a mother grizzly bear is very dangerous.

13
00:01:13.905 --> 00:01:19.500
She'll attack anyone who goes near her cubs.

14
00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:22.549
What do you eat?

15
00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:29.228
We eat berries, leaves, roots, and nuts.

16
00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:37.104
Sometimes we eat small animals or even moose.

17
00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:41.555
Grizzly bears go fishing too, right?

18
00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:46.535
We eat lots of salmon in the fall.

19
00:01:46.536 --> 00:01:51.326
That's when we get really fat.

20
00:01:51.327 --> 00:01:54.675
Why do you eat so much?

21
00:01:54.676 --> 00:01:59.198
We go into a deep sleep during winter.

22
00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:09.356
We will not eat again until spring.

23
00:02:09.357 --> 00:02:13.321
My winter den is ready now.

24
00:02:13.322 --> 00:02:16.331
Good night!

25
00:02:16.332 --> 00:02:23.987
Good night, Grizzly Bear!
